### PureLight™
An advanced material engineered at the nanoscale to manipulate heat and light. It transmits 95% of light of glass whilst providing superior insulation (~0.002–0.005 W/m·K). It is lightweight, durable, maximizes photosynthesis by maintaining stable temperatures for year-round crop growth.

